# Resolve the @pacific-code-labs scope to GitHub Packages (npm.pkg.github.com).
# This makes `npm publish` target GH Packages (paired with package.json
# publishConfig.registry) and lets installs of @pacific-code-labs/* resolve here.
# Auth: CI provides NODE_AUTH_TOKEN (the per-job GITHUB_TOKEN) via the
# actions/setup-node registry-url wiring; locally use a PAT with read:packages
# (or write:packages to publish) in your user ~/.npmrc, NOT committed here.
@pacific-code-labs:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
